t  J L N  lymph nodes  In a second container labeled  Right chest skin lesion is a 0 5cm in diameter polypoid white soft skin mass  Bisected entirely in M  Resident  John Andrew Carlson  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     TISSUE TAKEN FOR ER RIGHT CHEST WALL SKIN LESION   SENT FOR PERMANENTS O R  Resident  Mary K  Klassen  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Nancy Lee Harris  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Randall David Gaz  M D  W B Jerry Younger  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST  AXILLARY CONTENTS  CHEST WALL SKIN   report_end  , Primary_(If_case_diagnosed).
