ption by  LORI MARINI Resident  PAULA ARNELL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Kevin Hughes MD PART   BREAST RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Primary.
