ssue measuring 6 0cm in greatest dimension  which is lateral to the stellate shaped region  Scattered throughout the lower inner quadrant are several small  tan  fibrotic  irregular nodular areas  The remainder of the parenchyma is grossly unremarkable  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Stellate mass from lateral to medial  with mass to posterior margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Well circumscribed  large lobulated areas of fibrosis   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lower inner quadrant nodular areas   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of unremarkable breast parenchyma   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Sediment in the fixative    blood   Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on Thursday REMOVED_MONTH 16   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 05 23 42PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART   Breast  Right   Simple Mastectomy  report_end  , primary.
