ED_ACCESSION_ID  3 Cam5 2  cytokeratin 7  and pankeratin on three tissue levels for parts A  B and C support the above interpretations  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received are 3 containers  which are all  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  Received fresh  the Frozen Section Lab  labeled  right femoral node  hot and blue  right axilla   are 3 tan pink lymph nodes measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  The largest is bisected and entirely submitted for Frozen as FX  1  now as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The 2 smaller nodes are submitted for Frozen Section as FX  1A  now as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab  labeled  right sentinel lymph node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm tan pink lymph node with a small amount of attached fat  The fat is removed  and the node is bisected and entirely submitted for Frozen Section as FX  2  now as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab  labeled  left sentinel lymph node hot and blue   REMOVED_CASE_ID    is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm tan pink lymph node which is bisected and entirely submitted for Frozen Section as FX  3  now as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received are 2 containers  both of which are  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  Smith  REMOVE_MRN  Received fresh  labeled with  right breast  short superior  long lateral   is a 20 x 18 x 2 5cm oriented right simple mastectomy specimen with a short stitch designating superior  long stitch designating lateral margin  The anterior surface contains a 20 x 9 5cm tan brown grossly unremarkable skin ellipse which bears a 4 x 4cm areola   REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm nipple which are grossly unremarkable  The specimen is inked as follows  Anterior   blue  posterior   black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x 1 x 1cm hemorrhagic firm ill defined area present approximately between 8   9 o clock in the outer quadrant  contains a metallic clip    lies 2cm from the overlying skin   3 5cm from the posterior inked margin  The breast parenchyma adjacent to this ill defined firm area is tan white  nodular   contains dense fibrous tissue  The remaining breast parenchyma contains predominantly tan white rubbery fibrous tissue interspersed with a moderate amount of tan yellow lobulated adipose tissue  No additional discrete mass or lesion is grossly appreciated  The upper outer quadrant tissue is palpated for lymph nodes    no lymph nodes are grossly appreciated  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire ill defined hemorrhagic area to include closest posterior black inked margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  fibrous breast parenchyma  outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  fibrous breast parenchyma  inner quadrant  Received fresh  labeled with  left breast  short stitch superior  long stitch lateral   is a 21 x 19 x 2cm oriented left simple mastectomy specimen with a short stitch designating superior   long stitch designating lateral margin  The anterior surface bears a 21 x 10cm tan brown grossly unremarkable skin ellipse which contains a 4 x 4cm areola   a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm nipple  which are grossly unremarkable  The specimen is inked as follows  Anterior   blue  posterior   black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal predominantly tan white rubbery nodular breast parenchyma with occasional blue domed cysts interspersed with moderate amount of tan yellow lobulated adipose tissue  There is no discrete mass or lesion grossly appreciated  The upper outer quadrant tissue is palpated for lymph nodes    no lymph nodes are grossly appreciated  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  fibrous breast parenchyma  upper outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  fibrous breast parenchyma  outer lower quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  fibrous breast parenchyma  central region of breast   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  fibrous breast parenchyma  inner lower quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  fibrous breast parenchyma  inner upper quadrant  INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1    1A   RIGHT SENTINEL LYMPH NODE HOT   BLUE  RIGHT AXILLA   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  2   RIGHT SENTINEL LYMPH NODE   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  3   LEFT SENTINEL LYMPH NODE   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M D   Electronically signed on Monday REMOVED_MONTH 15   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 01 52 46PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON   1 QUANTITATIVE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR RECEPTOR PROTEINS Breast  Right  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    The ductal carcinoma in situ tumor cells stain for estrogen receptor protein  The ductal carcinoma in situ tumor cells stain for progesterone receptor protein  See note  Note  Estrogen and progesterone receptor quantitation  The percent of immunoreactive nuclei in the tumor cells is assessed visually and reported as follows    The tumor cells stain    10  of nuclei stained    Some tumor cells stain  1 to  10  of nuclei stained    Rare tumor cells stain    1  of nuclei stained    The tumor cells do not stain  0  of nuclei stained  These tests were developed and their performance characteristics determined by the Pathology Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test