Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  Final Type  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  OPERATION DATE  25 REMOVED_MONTH 96 ACCESSIONED ON  25 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 14 01 CLINICAL DATA                                                                                      FINAL DIAGNOSIS     BREAST  RIGHT   BIOPSY  INVASIVE DUCTAL CARCINOMA  REMOVED_DATE CM  GRADE 2  FOCALLY EXTENDING TO THE MARGIN OF THE SPECIMEN  DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  EXTENDING AWAY FROM THE MASS  SEE NOTE  NOTE  Blood vessel and lymphatic vessel invasion is not identified  The frozen section diagnosis is confirmed  Diagnosis by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  01 AUG 96 at 09 21                                                                                     RECEPTOR IMMUNOHISTOCHEMISTRY Addendum     RESULTS OF STAINING OF FIXED TISSUE FOR HORMONE RECEPTOR PROTEINS BREAST  RIGHT   The tumor cells stain for estrogen receptor protein  The tumor cells stain for progesterone receptor protein  See note  Note  In this laboratory  we used this antibody to stain 100 breast carcinomas prepared in the usual way  paraffin sections  and we compared the results with determinations of estrogen receptor by biochemical assay  91  of tumors that stained with this antibody were positive for estrogen receptors by biochemical assay  96  of tumors that failed to stain with this antibody were negative for estrogen receptors by biochemical assay  When we compared the results of staining of paraffin sections with the results of staining of frozen sections  the predictive value of a positive result was 97  and the predictive value of a negative result was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  09 AUG 96 at 11 14 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm breast tissue containing a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm well defined irregular firm white mass which extends to the margin of resection  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes A through F  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  ALEXANDER KRATZ  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  SMALL INVASIVE CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Ross C  Wheeler  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Kenneth Kenji Tanabe  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST BIOPSY   report_end  , Primary_(If_case_diagnosed).
