d and microscopically evaluated  BREAST  RIGHT   FINAL SUPERIOR MEDIAL MARGIN    EXCISION  DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  GRADE 3  OCCUPYING ONE DUCT SITUATED MORE THAN REMOVED_DATE CM FROM THE FINAL MARGIN OF THE SPECIMEN  HEALING BIOPSY SITE  SEE NOTE  NOTE  The carcinoma in situ in this specimen resembles the one detected in the specimen labeled  final inferior margin   Invasion of the stroma  blood vessels  and lymphatic vessels is not seen  BREAST  RIGHT   FINAL SUPERIOR MARGIN    EXCISION  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  SEE NOTE  NOTE  The resection margins of the specimen were inked and microscopically evaluated  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Unfixed  labeled  Margaret Braman  REMOVED_DATE  right breast lumpectomy   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm piece of yellow pink fibroadipose tissue with a localization wire  The specimen is inked  It consists of yellow lobulated adipose tissue with scant tan white rubbery fibrous tissue and foci of hemorrhage throughout  A clip is present  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  with the clip site in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   In fixative  labeled  Margaret Braman  REMOVED_DATE  right breast final margin lateral   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm piece of unremarkable fibroadipose tissue with a suture at one aspect  which is inked  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   In fixative  labeled  Margaret Braman  REMOVED_DATE  right breast final margin inferior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm piece of unremarkable fibroadipose tissue with a suture at one aspect  which is inked  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   In fixative  labeled  Margaret Braman  REMOVED_DATE  final margin deep right breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm piece of unremarkable fibroadipose tissue with a suture at one aspect  which is inked  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_