able fibrofatty tissue with a few tan pink cystic structures  averaging 0 2cm in diameter  Representative sections are sequentially submitted from lateral to medial in cassettes A J as follow  A F  Area denoted by the lateral localization wire  G H  Fibrous tissue with cystic structures  I  Well circumscribed medial mass  entirely submitted   J  Medial margin  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  NICOLE ANN BELSLEY  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Kevin S  Hughes  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Primary_(If_case_diagnosed).
