d with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  19 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 08 11 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast mass  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 4cm unoriented piece of fibroadipose tissue with multiple needle localization wires  There is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm firm  white nodule that grossly abuts the margin and several smaller nodules ranging from 0 2cm to 0 3cm in diameter  Representative sections are submitted in A through J  Gross Description by  MELINDA J  FAN  MD Resident  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D      INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS   LEFT BREAST   LESION SUSPICIOUS FOR CARCINOMA  TOO SMALL TO FREEZE  O R  Resident  MELINDA J  FAN  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Gunnlaugur P  Nielsen  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Susan E Briggs  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Diagnosis_(only_if_excisional_biopsy).
